This project is an add-on for Advent of Ascension ("AoA"), a Minecraft mod
developed by Tslat. It contains no AoA code, assets, or other intellectual
property: the soil names it references are registry names, and every texture is
a vanilla Minecraft texture recoloured to an AoA block's palette. AoA's own
license (https://github.com/Tslat/Advent-Of-Ascension, LICENSE.md) permits the
creation and distribution of extensions and add-ons. AoA remains the property of
its author; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Tslat.
